# %trace from Methods, bound in Target

`%trace` is a Target function used as an expression. It peeks at a value and returns it. Blocks stay lets plus one result.

## Schema

```
Rect = Int/x Int/y Int/width Int/height
```

## Construction

```
[:Rect 0 0 10 20]
```

## Methods

```
Rect::area = { %trace(width * height) }
```

## Target

```
%trace
public static function wchnt_trace<T>(x:T):T {
    haxe.Log.trace(x);
    return x;
}

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = rectFactory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    assemblage.area();
}
```
